# API
@password={$env PASSWORD}

### Getting all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Create a new user

POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

    {    
            "username": "pirapat",
            "email": "pirapat-p@rmutp.ac.th",
            "password": "{{PASSWORD}}"
    }

